<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-11101] Web console: validation does not work properly in corner case in Firefox</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-11101</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;You should use Firefox&lt;br/&gt;
Configuration - Cluster - Advanced - Data storage configuration&lt;br/&gt;
Enter a literal value into System region / Initial size&lt;br/&gt;
Save&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Two points:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;alternate&quot; type=&quot;square&quot;&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;no error message on entering the incorrect value&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;no error message on Save and incorrect field is not on a viewport&lt;br/&gt;
 &lt;span class=&quot;image-wrap&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/attachment/12956547/12956547_screenshot-1.png&quot; style=&quot;border: 0px solid black&quot; /&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

</description>
