                                <comments>
                            <comment id="16754665" author="klaster_1" created="Tue, 29 Jan 2019 06:55:35 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=pkonstantinov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;pkonstantinov&quot;&gt;pkonstantinov&lt;/a&gt; issue #2 was probably fixed in &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-10489&quot; title=&quot;Web console: validation messages are shown twice in configuration&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-10489&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-10489&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16754689" author="klaster_1" created="Tue, 29 Jan 2019 07:37:29 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=pkonstantinov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;pkonstantinov&quot;&gt;pkonstantinov&lt;/a&gt; issue #1 (no error message) is caused by the way form-field-size handles validation. I have an idea how to prevent this class of issues, but it will require major refactoring of inputs, so I&apos;m inclined to ignore the for now.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;On a side note, &lt;a href=&quot;https://stackoverflow.com/a/49923874/333777&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;Firefox does not restrict text input into number fields by design&lt;/a&gt;, but it will validate the value.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16754724" author="klaster_1" created="Tue, 29 Jan 2019 08:25:50 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Scroll to input has been fixed. It worked, but overlay header hid the element.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;What to test:&lt;br/&gt;
1. Invalid element is scrolled into view in Firefox and Safari, Chrome should do the same as before.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16754725" author="klaster_1" created="Tue, 29 Jan 2019 08:27:42 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=alexdel&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;alexdel&quot;&gt;alexdel&lt;/a&gt; please review.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16755729" author="pkonstantinov" created="Wed, 30 Jan 2019 06:29:26 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Tested under Firefox, Chrome, Safari,&lt;br/&gt;
For MS Edge a new issue was created &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-11132&quot; title=&quot;Web console: scrolling to invalid field works incorrectly under the MS Edge&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-11132&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-11132&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16756693" author="kuaw26" created="Wed, 30 Jan 2019 23:52:08 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Looks good to me. Merged to master.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
